SAFETY WARNING
================================================================================

When using ECG acquisition hardware:
- Use only battery-powered, isolated devices
- Never connect to mains-powered equipment while attached to a person
- Follow all electrical safety guidelines
- Obtain proper training before use
- Have emergency procedures in place

